# The cartridge ROM is copyrighted and is not distributed here. Put your
# own copy at the repo root; see the README.
*.rom

# Extracted game assets. These are Konami's data, just decompressed out of
# the ROM, so they are not distributed either -- rebuild them with:
#   go run ./cmd/extract
# assets/assets.go is source and stays tracked; only the extracted binary
# data is ignored.
assets/**/*.bin
assets/*.bin

# The generated disassembly listing, likewise derived from the ROM.
# Rebuild it with:
#   go run ./cmd/disasm -rom "Road Fighter - Konami (1985) [7349].rom" -out docs/listing.asm
docs/listing.asm

# cmd/play's frame dumps.
frame.png

# Stray `go build` output at the repo root (use `go run ./cmd/<tool>`).
/extract
/play
/disasm
/screenshot

.DS_Store

# serena auto-generated config
.serena/
